+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes it readable by anyone who knows its secret public URL, without signing in. Only account administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+The public URL of a published board is returned in the `public_url` attribute of the board. It is `null` when the board isn't published.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a Board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board, including its `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/2Xk9pWq7nLmRt4vYbZcH3sJd"
+}
+```
+
+Publishing an already published board keeps the same public URL.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a Board. The public URL stops working immediately, and a new one is generated if the board is published again.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
